+- Moving a task requires the manager role in the source project and write access (contributor or manager) in the destination. The destination must be readable (else 404), not archived (else 409), and different from the source (else 400). The task keeps its ID, title, status and assignee; the assignee must be a contributor or manager of the destination, otherwise the move is 400 and nothing changes.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
